{"toolCallId":"call_79a75fe1124e4dcc948cabfea94633f1","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"\nSpec Folder Validation v3.0.0\n\n  Folder: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n  Level:  3\n  Engine: orchestrator\n\n+ FILE_EXISTS: All required files present for Level 3\n! PLACEHOLDER_FILLED: 6 unfilled value token(s) in a Draft packet. Fill each one before the status leaves Draft\n    - implementation-summary.md:50: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Opening hook: 2-3 sentences on what changed and why it matters. Lead with impact.]\n    - implementation-summary.md:61: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: path] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Created/Modified/Deleted] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What this change accomplishe\n    - implementation-summary.md:70: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How was this tested, verified and shipped? What was the rollout approach?]\n    - implementation-summary.md:81: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What was decided] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Active-voice rationale with specific reasoning] |\n    - implementation-summary.md:92: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Validation, lint, tests, manual check] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: PASS/FAIL with specifics] |\n    - implementation-summary.md:101: 1. **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Limitation]** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Specific detail with workaround if one exists.]\n+ TEMPLATE_SOURCE: Template source headers present\n+ ANCHORS_VALID: Anchors well formed in 5 file(s)\n+ FRONTMATTER_VALID: Frontmatter continuity basics present\n+ FRONTMATTER_MEMORY_BLOCK: All spec-doc frontmatter memory blocks are structurally valid\n+ SPEC_DOC_SUFFICIENCY: All targeted spec-doc anchors meet the sufficiency baseline\n+ MERGE_LEGALITY: No merge plan supplied; legality check skipped\n+ CROSS_ANCHOR_CONTAMINATION: No routing payload supplied; contamination check skipped\n+ POST_SAVE_FINGERPRINT: No post-save p