measurable outcome]\n    - spec.md:116: | Dependency | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: System/API] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What if blocked] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Fallback plan] |\n    - spec.md:117: | Risk | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Risk description] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: High/Med/Low] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Mitigation strategy] \n    - spec.md:127: - **NFR-P01**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Response time target - e.g., <200ms p95]\n    - spec.md:130: - **NFR-S01**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Auth requirement - e.g., JWT tokens required]\n    - spec.md:133: - **NFR-R01**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Uptime target - e.g., 99.9%]\n    - spec.md:141: - Empty input: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How system handles]\n    - spec.md:142: - Maximum length: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Limit and behavior]\n    - spec.md:145: - External service failure: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Fallback behavior]\n    - spec.md:146: - Network timeout: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Retry strategy]\n    - spec.md:149: - Partial completion: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Recovery behavior]\n    - spec.md:150: - Session expiry: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: User experience]\n    - spec.md:159: | Scope | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /25] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Files: X, LOC: Y, Systems: Z] |\n    - spec.md:160: | Risk | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /25] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Auth: Y/N, API: Y/N, Breaking: Y/N] |\n    - spec.md:161: | Research | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /20] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Investigation needs] |\n    - spec.md:162: | Multi-Agent | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /15] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Workstreams: X] |\n    - spec.md:163: | Coordination | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /15] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Dependencies: X] |\n    - spec.md:164: | **Total** | **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: /100]** | **Level 3** |\n    - spec.md:173: | R-001 | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Risk] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: H/M/L] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: H/M/L] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Strategy] |\n    - spec.md:180: ### US-001: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Title] (Priority: P0)\n    - spec.md:182: **As a** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: user type], **I want** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: needed behavior], **so that** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: bene\n    - spec.md:188: ### U