.sh` if a lifecycle stage is missing or inconsistent\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/spec-lifecycle-automation.md:240:Provenance: manual only - bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh --help\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/phase-command-workflow.md:44:2. Verify Step 1: Phase scoring runs (recommend-level.sh --recommend-phases)\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/phase-command-workflow.md:61:$ bash \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh\" --json --recommend-phases --phase-threshold 0.6 --loc 500 --files 8\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/phase-command-workflow.md:66:$ bash \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh\" --json --recommend-phases --phase-threshold 300 --loc 500 --files 8\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/template-authoring/level-1-packet-authored-from-card.md:74:BANNED OPERATIONS: git commit, git push, git checkout, git switch, git branch, git reset, git stash, generate-context.js, /speckit:save, and any edit outside specs/zz-pb-card/. Do not edit recommend-level.sh. Do not edit anything under .skilled/.\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/template-authoring/level-1-packet-authored-from-card.md:79:3. Fill spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md and implementation-summary.md. Describe this feature in the packet and do not build it: a --quiet flag for .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh that prints only the final recommended-level line. Say in implementation-summary.md that the packet is planned and not implemented.\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/README.md:514:bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh specs/[project]/NNN-feature/\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/README.md:621:| `recommend-level.sh` | 